cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: Simultaneous identities of the golden ratio and Euler's identity,
  formally verified in Lean 4 over the known Mersenne prime exponents
type: software
version: 0.3.11
date-released: 2026-07-29
